<ul><li><span data-mw-comment-start="" id="c-V8rik-2012-04-10T17:00:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z"></span>No error. There are 6 carbon atoms in the picture, 5 in the ring and one more in the chain between the two oxygen atoms, chemists are lazy and not always bother to actually show a carbon atom. <a href="/wiki/User:V8rik" title="User:V8rik">V8rik</a> (<a href="/wiki/User_talk:V8rik" title="User talk:V8rik">talk</a>) <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Organic_chemistry#c-V8rik-2012-04-10T17:00:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z" class="ext-discussiontools-init-timestamplink">17:00, 10 April 2012 (UTC)</a><span class="ext-discussiontools-init-replylink-buttons" data-mw-thread-id="c-V8rik-2012-04-10T17:00:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z"><span class="ext-discussiontools-init-replylink-bracket">[</span><a class="ext-discussiontools-init-replylink-reply" role="button" tabindex="0" href="">reply</a><span class="ext-discussiontools-init-replylink-bracket">]</span><!--__DTELLIPSISBUTTON__{"threadItem":{"timestamp":"2012-04-10T17:00:00.000Z","author":"V8rik","type":"comment","level":2,"id":"c-V8rik-2012-04-10T17:00:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z","replies":[]}}--></span><span data-mw-comment-end="c-V8rik-2012-04-10T17:00:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z"></span></li></ul>
<dl><dd><span data-mw-comment-start="" id="c-DMacks-2012-04-10T17:07:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z"></span>This style is even explained in the "Structural drawings" subsection of the same "Nomenclature" section where this image is used. <a href="/wiki/Skeletal_formula" title="Skeletal formula">Skeletal formula</a> is the main article on this style. <a href="/wiki/User:DMacks" title="User:DMacks">DMacks</a> (<a href="/wiki/User_talk:DMacks" title="User talk:DMacks">talk</a>) <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Organic_chemistry#c-DMacks-2012-04-10T17:07:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z" class="ext-discussiontools-init-timestamplink">17:07, 10 April 2012 (UTC)</a><span class="ext-discussiontools-init-replylink-buttons" data-mw-thread-id="c-DMacks-2012-04-10T17:07:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z"><span class="ext-discussiontools-init-replylink-bracket">[</span><a class="ext-discussiontools-init-replylink-reply" role="button" tabindex="0" href="">reply</a><span class="ext-discussiontools-init-replylink-bracket">]</span><!--__DTELLIPSISBUTTON__{"threadItem":{"timestamp":"2012-04-10T17:07:00.000Z","author":"DMacks","type":"comment","level":2,"id":"c-DMacks-2012-04-10T17:07:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z","replies":["c-Edgar181-2012-04-10T17:21:00.000Z-DMacks-2012-04-10T17:07:00.000Z"]}}--></span><span data-mw-comment-end="c-DMacks-2012-04-10T17:07:00.000Z-75.114.179.51-2012-04-09T21:27:00.000Z"></span>
